# Token Action HUD Core 1.2.0
This minor release adds a grid layout option and a Pathfinder-inspired style in preparation for Pathfinder 2 support.

**IMPORTANT:** This release is not compatible with Token Action HUD system modules that require minor version 1.1.1 or earlier. Do not update Token Action HUD Core until all your installed Token Action HUD system modules support this version.

## New Features
### Grid Layout (#20)
Display individual categories in a grid layout using the category dialog or for all actions by enabling the 'Grid' module setting. Grid layout per subcategory will come a bit later.
![token-action-hud-grid-layout](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/105953297/217959918-affd0053-ffc7-4301-8fac-f947367b295e.gif)

### Pathfinder-Inspired Style
Enable a Pathfinder-inspired HUD style by selecting 'Pathfinder' from the 'Style' module setting. Note, the screenshot is from D&D 5e as the Token Action HUD Pathfinder 2 system module is still in development.
![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/105953297/217960626-d8e5e7e7-30cf-4302-96dc-5eb62b5a7089.png)

## Bug Fixes
- Fixed a bug that stopped the subcategory dialog from opening for newly created categories (#47).

## Improvements
- Improved auto-sizing of HUD to stop it blocking as much of the canvas underneath (#46).
- When the HUD closes, a clicked open category will also be closed (#45).

## Important Changes for TAH System Module Developers
The `SystemManager#doRegisterDefaultFlags` method now just requires the object for default categories and subcategories to be returned. The `setFlag` part is now handled  by the core `registerDefaultFlags` method, which calls `doRegisterDefaultFlags`. Here's an example where `DEFAULTS` is the object of default categories and subcategories:

```js
async doRegisterDefaultFlags () {
    const defaults = {
        categories: [
            {
                nestId: 'inventory',
                id: 'inventory',
                name: game.i18n.localize('DND5E.Inventory'),
                subcategories: [
                    {
                        nestId: 'inventory_weapons',
                        id: 'weapons',
                        name: game.i18n.localize('ITEM.TypeWeaponPl'),
                        type: 'system',
                        hasDerivedSubcategories: false
                    }
                    // FURTHER SUBCATEGORIES HERE
                ]
            }
            // FURTHER CATEGORIES HERE

        ],
        subcategories: [
            { id: 'weapons', name: game.i18n.localize('ITEM.TypeWeaponPl'), type: 'system', hasDerivedSubcategories: false }
            // FURTHER  SUBCATEGORIES HERE
        ]
    }

    return defaults
}
````
